<title>UK: UK stocks rise revised 580 mln stg in Q4.</title>
<headline>UK stocks rise revised 580 mln stg in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics issued the following revised data on manufacturers, wholesalers and retailers stocks in the fourth quarter of 1996</p>
<p>- (preliminary figures in brackets)</p>
<p>    STOCKS (in million stg) Q4		Q3	    Q4,95</p>
<p>    Total			 580   (674)  -826	    823</p>
<p>    Manufacturing	     125   (307)  -172	    562</p>
<p>    Mining &amp; Quarrying	-57   (-67)   -76	    -22</p>
<p>    Electricity,gas &amp; water  18    (56)   -22	    -26</p>
<p>    Construction		 30    (91)  -195	   -154</p>
<p>    Motor trades		 69   (144)   109	    226</p>
<p>    Wholesaling		 187   (-34)  -354	     29</p>
<p>    Retailing		   208   (177)  -116	    208</p>
</text>
